<div class="page-width page-margin">
  <div class="rte">
    <h1>Returns / Refund Policy</h1>

    <p>At LAMBATY, we want you to feel confident in your purchase. If something is not right with your order, please review the policy below and contact us as soon as possible.</p>

    <h2>7-Day Return Window</h2>
    <p>Return requests should be submitted within 7 days of delivery.</p>
    <p>To help us review your request quickly, please contact us at <a href="mailto:info@lambaty.sa">info@lambaty.sa</a> and include your order number and relevant details.</p>

    <h2>Return Eligibility</h2>
    <p>Return eligibility depends on the reason for the request and the condition of the product.</p>

    <h3>Damaged, Defective, or Incorrect Products</h3>
    <p>Please contact us if:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Your order arrives with visible physical damage</li>
      <li>The lamp has a genuine functional issue</li>
      <li>The product received is incorrect</li>
      <li>A major component is missing from the order</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Where relevant, we may request clear photos or videos so our team can review the issue.</p>

    <h3>Change-of-Mind Returns</h3>
    <p>If you change your mind, you may request a return within 7 days of delivery, provided the product meets the following conditions:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>The product is unused</li>
      <li>The product is in its original condition</li>
      <li>The original packaging is included</li>
      <li>All accessories, manuals, and included components are returned</li>
      <li>The product has not been damaged, modified, or tampered with</li>
    </ul>
    <p>For eligible change-of-mind returns or returns based on personal preference, the customer is responsible for return shipping costs.</p>

    <h2>Non-Eligible Returns</h2>
    <p>A return may not be accepted where:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>The product has been damaged through misuse or improper handling</li>
      <li>The product has been modified, altered, or tampered with</li>
      <li>Damage results from incorrect installation or use contrary to the provided instructions</li>
      <li>Major accessories or components are missing</li>
      <li>The product shows excessive use beyond reasonable inspection</li>
      <li>The damage occurred after delivery and was caused by the customer</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>How to Request a Return</h2>
    <ol>
      <li>
        <strong>Contact Us</strong><br>
        Email <a href="mailto:info@lambaty.sa">info@lambaty.sa</a> within the applicable return period.<br>
        Please include:
        <ul>
          <li>Your order number</li>
          <li>The reason for the return</li>
          <li>A clear description of the issue</li>
          <li>Photos or videos where relevant</li>
          <li>Photos of the packaging where relevant</li>
        </ul>
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Request Review</strong><br>
        Our team will review the information provided and contact you with the next steps.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Return the Product</strong><br>
        If the return is approved, you will receive return instructions.<br>
        Please do not send a product back before receiving return instructions from LAMBATY.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Inspection</strong><br>
        Once received, the returned product will be inspected to confirm its condition and eligibility.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Refund or Resolution</strong><br>
        If approved after inspection, the applicable refund or resolution will be processed.
      </li>
    </ol>

    <h2>Damaged or Defective Products</h2>
    <p>If your lamp arrives with visible physical damage or you discover a genuine functional issue, please contact us within 7 days of delivery so our team can review the matter as quickly as possible.</p>
    <p>When contacting us, please include:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Your order number</li>
      <li>A clear description of the issue</li>
      <li>Clear photos or videos showing the damage or problem</li>
      <li>Photos of the packaging where relevant</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Please keep the original product packaging and included accessories while the issue is being reviewed.</p>

    <h2>Return Shipping Costs</h2>
    <p>If the return is due to a confirmed defect, physical damage not caused by the customer, or an incorrect product sent by LAMBATY, we will cover the applicable return shipping costs.</p>
    <p>For eligible change-of-mind returns or returns based on personal preference, the customer is responsible for return shipping costs.</p>

    <h2>Refunds</h2>
    <p>Approved refunds will be issued to the original payment method used for the purchase.</p>
    <p>Approved refunds are typically processed within 5-10 business days after the returned product has been received, inspected, and approved.</p>
    <p>Once processed by LAMBATY, additional time may be required for the refund to appear in your account depending on your bank or payment provider.</p>

    <h2>Applicable Rights</h2>
    <p>This policy does not limit any rights or remedies that may apply under applicable law.</p>

    <h2>Need Help?</h2>
    <p>For return or refund questions, contact us at: <a href="mailto:info@lambaty.sa">info@lambaty.sa</a></p>
    <p>We aim to respond within 1-2 business days.</p>
  </div>
</div>

